# The docs index is a manifest of one-line rows, and parallel doc changes
# insert different rows at the same section tails. Union keeps both sides'
# rows instead of raising conflict markers over insert position alone.
# scripts/check_docs_index.py --dedupe removes any exact duplicates union
# leaves behind, and the checker still fails closed on every outcome union
# cannot settle: duplicate targets, deleted targets and malformed rows.
docs/README.md merge=union
